  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who are familiar with the Power Rangers franchise and who may be exposed to or propagate racist tropes, particularly those who engage with internet humor that relies on dehumanizing stereotypes. The meme is designed to appeal to an audience that understands the Power Rangers context and can interpret the false equivalence between the Black Ranger’s costume and the green-skinned ape-like figure, thereby reinforcing anti-Black racism. The confident Black man’s image is used to falsely validate the racist comparison, which targets audiences who may be conditioned to accept or mock such stereotypes.",
